    "detailed_description": "\u3010Second in the Ninja Kato series!\u3011<br />\r\nA side-scrolling 2D action game.<br />\r\nAfter completing his training in &quot;NINJA KATO 1,&quot; the robot ninja Kato takes on the next challenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis time, the task given to Kato by his master is to avoid the approaching cannonballs and use items<br />\r\nto reach the top floor where his master is waiting as quickly as possible.<br />\r\nKato will be evaluated by his master based on the time he clears!<br />\r\nReach the master as quickly as possible and earn a high reputation!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter clearing all stages, Kato will take on an even more difficult stage.<br />\r\nWhen all training is completed, Kato will make new history!",
    "about_the_game": "\u3010Second in the Ninja Kato series!\u3011<br />\r\nA side-scrolling 2D action game.<br />\r\nAfter completing his training in &quot;NINJA KATO 1,&quot; the robot ninja Kato takes on the next challenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis time, the task given to Kato by his master is to avoid the approaching cannonballs and use items<br />\r\nto reach the top floor where his master is waiting as quickly as possible.<br />\r\nKato will be evaluated by his master based on the time he clears!<br />\r\nReach the master as quickly as possible and earn a high reputation!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter clearing all stages, Kato will take on an even more difficult stage.<br />\r\nWhen all training is completed, Kato will make new history!",
    "short_description": "\u3010Second in the Ninja Kato series!\u3011 A side-scrolling 2D action game. Control the robot ninja Kato and train him to become a full-fledged ninja.",
